WEBVTT

00:16.564 --> 00:18.390
It can't be, you...!

00:19.260 --> 00:20.564
Why me...?!

00:22.085 --> 00:23.090
Mizuki!

00:24.085 --> 00:25.085
Nothing personal.

00:26.218 --> 00:29.956
I just don't like seeing anyone get close to that person.

00:29.956 --> 00:31.869
Mizuki!

00:32.850 --> 00:34.130
Mizuki! Mizuki! Mizuki!

00:34.130 --> 00:35.953
Mizuki!

00:36.130 --> 00:38.608
Devastatingly handsome!

00:41.437 --> 00:48.437
KIREPAPA

00:48.624 --> 00:53.557
Episode 2: For You

01:00.627 --> 01:04.130
Chisato-san, you've seen that so many times already.
Aren't you getting sick of it?

01:04.506 --> 01:06.216
As if I could ever get sick of this!

01:06.550 --> 01:09.346
It's the Mizuki series, object of my undying affection!

01:09.346 --> 01:13.346
And... it's your work, Shunsuke, the man I love.

01:14.913 --> 01:18.604
Oh, geez, you're so...

01:21.064 --> 01:25.085
As a matter of fact, Saki Shunka, who is the original
author of this drama, the Mizuki series...

01:25.085 --> 01:30.048
and my boyfriend, Sakaki Shunsuke,
happen to be one and the same person.

01:30.616 --> 01:33.130
A lot happened before I started going out with him,

01:33.130 --> 01:35.287
but now they're all just good memories.

01:35.652 --> 01:37.055
I'm home!

01:41.521 --> 01:43.260
W-Welcome back, Riju!

01:43.260 --> 01:47.955
A bug just got into my clothes, you see...
Shunsuke was trying to help get it out, that's why he...

01:48.050 --> 01:50.652
Riju, that's why I told you...

01:50.652 --> 01:52.825
We really shouldn't interrupt them.

01:52.825 --> 01:54.473
Yeah, you're right, Kakeru.

01:54.782 --> 01:56.955
I'll go run to my room and change.

01:57.739 --> 01:58.994
Hold it right there!

01:59.346 --> 02:03.042
You're even waltzing into my house now?
You've got some real nerve!

02:03.042 --> 02:10.422
This shady fellow, Nijo Kakeru, calls himself the boyfriend
of my beloved Riju--my life, the apple of my eye.

02:11.782 --> 02:15.738
Until now, I resorted to any savage measure to send
all the men who tried to get close to Riju packing,

02:15.739 --> 02:17.260
but that's not going to work for this one!

02:17.871 --> 02:20.433
Will you not even allow me to stay at your side?

02:23.710 --> 02:26.390
Mizu... Mizuki!

02:26.713 --> 02:31.956
And the reason why is that Nijo Kakeru is also the actor
behind the man I adore and worship, Mizuki.

02:31.956 --> 02:34.130
Oh, Mizuki!

02:34.130 --> 02:35.303
Chisato-san.

02:35.889 --> 02:37.781
It's about time you opened your eyes.

02:37.782 --> 02:40.999
I keep telling you he's not actually Mizuki.

02:41.895 --> 02:42.999
That's right!

02:43.000 --> 02:45.739
Kakeru may be the actor playing Mizuki,

02:45.739 --> 02:49.999
but his true nature is a vermin--no, a wild
beast, stalking Riju and waiting to strike!

02:50.000 --> 02:52.347
I am dead set against him associating with Riju!

02:52.347 --> 02:53.216
If it comes to this...

02:53.287 --> 02:55.874
Book: The Scarlet Wail - Saki Shunka. The latest novel in the Mizuki series. The slaughter just doesn't stop! The 8th installment in the horror series.

02:53.913 --> 02:59.130
I'll commit the perfect crime from Shunsuke's new
book on you! I got an early copy from him!

02:59.204 --> 03:00.347
You better get ready for it!

03:00.816 --> 03:04.477
I've already read that book myself,
so there's no point in trying.

03:05.739 --> 03:10.652
It hasn't been released yet, how the
hell have you read it already?!

03:10.652 --> 03:15.086
I'm enjoying a very good relationship with Shunsuke-san
through my work on the drama.

03:16.054 --> 03:17.695
"A good relationship"...?

03:18.260 --> 03:21.351
Oh God, I'm gonna come...

03:22.695 --> 03:26.695
Sensei, I'm the older one here! Why are you so good at this?

03:27.190 --> 03:30.695
Maybe it seems that way to you because
you only play around with Riju.

03:30.695 --> 03:33.652
You were meant to be loved.

03:34.639 --> 03:36.042
You despicable cur!

03:36.042 --> 03:40.738
Riju wasn't enough for you, so you've got your
lecherous paws all over Shunsuke, too?!

03:44.086 --> 03:47.216
How exactly does your brain reach
these bizarre conclusions?

03:47.217 --> 03:50.042
Kakeru-san, I'm sure you can guess what I want to say.

03:50.422 --> 03:52.303
Don't get mad, Sensei.

03:52.303 --> 03:55.635
We finally got a chance to see each other, too.

03:57.387 --> 03:59.172
Oh, that's right, Papa!

03:59.173 --> 04:01.042
W-What is it, Riju?

04:01.391 --> 04:04.955
Can go on a trip with Kakeru for winter break?

04:07.868 --> 04:11.042
OF COURSE NOT!

04:12.825 --> 04:15.695
Why do you just blindly insist on saying no?

04:16.031 --> 04:18.434
Why? Obviously because...

04:20.535 --> 04:24.303
Riju, what's wrong? Why are you scowling like that?

04:24.498 --> 04:27.477
Kakeru has to be on location all through the holidays,

04:27.478 --> 04:31.434
so if I don't go with him, we can't spend
Christmas or New Year's together!

04:32.478 --> 04:36.564
Well, Christmas and New Year's are holidays
you're supposed to spend with your family!

04:37.478 --> 04:39.173
And if he goes on a trip...

04:40.608 --> 04:46.781
Hey, Riju. If you soil the hot springs, you'll have to get on
your knees right here and apologize in front of everybody.

04:46.782 --> 04:51.129
No, don't, Kakeru! The water... the water'll get inside!

04:51.825 --> 04:54.738
Better not come yet. You can hold it in, right?

04:55.695 --> 05:00.086
I-I can't...! Please, let me...! Kakeru!

05:02.652 --> 05:04.329
You are not going and that's final!

05:06.289 --> 05:07.086
Papa!

05:20.595 --> 05:23.129
He hasn't spoken to you since then?

05:24.850 --> 05:27.216
I can't believe Riju talked back to me...

05:27.216 --> 05:30.981
He couldn't be going through a rebellious phase, not Riju...!

05:32.274 --> 05:36.129
But it's unfortunate that you'll be spending
the holidays with family.

05:36.445 --> 05:40.521
I'd actually been planning to steal you away myself.

05:41.700 --> 05:43.217
Steal me away? To where?

05:44.953 --> 05:48.608
To think I'll also have to be on location for
the Mizuki drama, unable to see you...

05:49.082 --> 05:53.434
Mizuki? So that's what Riju meant when
he said Kakeru had to be on location?

05:53.434 --> 05:58.043
Then that means I won't see Shunsuke for
Christmas Eve or the New Year's holiday?

05:59.050 --> 06:01.608
Now I understand exactly how Riju feels...

06:04.086 --> 06:09.259
Oh, really? Well, I'll miss you, but it's all right, I have Riju.

06:09.478 --> 06:10.999
Must say, I'm jealous.

06:11.000 --> 06:14.065
I want to make your body unable to stand being without me.

06:14.941 --> 06:16.276
Shunsuke...

06:21.031 --> 06:26.161
Well, we won't be seeing each other for a while
starting tomorrow, so let's enjoy our time now.

06:26.828 --> 06:28.621
Yeah, you're right!

06:31.249 --> 06:34.377
Huh? Did Riju go to sleep already?

06:37.234 --> 06:38.521
To Papa

06:43.220 --> 06:44.913
What's the matter, Chisato-san?

06:45.222 --> 06:49.518
You won't accept it, so I'm just going anyway.
Don't worry about me! - Riju

06:50.060 --> 06:53.146
This means... Riju ran away from home?

06:53.478 --> 06:56.912
Ran away...

06:57.400 --> 06:59.235
Chisato-san, are you okay?

06:59.736 --> 07:03.564
I don't know what to do. He's never
done anything like this before.

07:04.032 --> 07:06.303
If anything happens to him...

07:06.303 --> 07:07.619
It's all right.

07:08.578 --> 07:11.433
They must have gone to the inn where we're filming.

07:11.434 --> 07:14.042
If we go after them now, we can be
there before the end of the day.

07:14.584 --> 07:15.781
Shunsuke!

07:15.782 --> 07:18.338
I'm so glad Shunsuke is here...

07:19.214 --> 07:22.216
Okay. Where's the inn?

07:22.216 --> 07:25.173
I believe it was called something like "Ginsetsukan"...

07:26.173 --> 07:29.782
What did you say?!

07:33.854 --> 07:36.130
This inn is Papa's family home!

07:37.691 --> 07:39.216
That's a real surprise.

07:39.216 --> 07:43.651
Who would've thought the on-site accommodations they
set us up with are at Chisato-san's family home...

07:44.197 --> 07:46.032
Come on, let's go, Kakeru!

07:47.701 --> 07:50.781
Riju, you don't need to force yourself to be cheerful.

07:50.782 --> 07:53.869
You're worried about Chisato-san, aren't you?

07:54.564 --> 07:56.781
N-No, I'm not!

07:56.782 --> 07:59.782
I'm really happy I can be together with you!

07:59.869 --> 08:02.303
Sure, I wish Papa had accepted it, but...

08:02.757 --> 08:08.303
Getting to spend all this time together
is like a dream come true!

08:17.981 --> 08:21.401
I'm the eldest son, Chitose. I work as chief manager.

08:22.193 --> 08:25.086
I'm the second son, Chidori. I work as head chef.

08:25.086 --> 08:27.907
I'm the father, Chihiro. I work as director.

08:28.283 --> 08:30.955
It's only a small inn, but do make yourself at home.

08:31.202 --> 08:33.695
Tha-Thank you very much.

08:33.695 --> 08:34.565
Grandpa!

08:34.607 --> 08:35.434
Riju!

08:35.434 --> 08:36.521
Grandpa!

08:36.521 --> 08:39.225
It's in their blood. Horrifying blood...

08:37.365 --> 08:38.885
You're so adorable!

08:39.521 --> 08:41.651
That's not fair, Dad.

08:39.725 --> 08:41.505
I'm so glad you came!

08:41.652 --> 08:43.564
Now, Riju, come over here.

08:43.564 --> 08:46.521
That's right! Riju belongs to everyone.

08:46.760 --> 08:49.694
How dare you speak to your father like that!

08:50.430 --> 08:52.956
I don't feel like I got away from Chisato-san at all...

08:52.956 --> 08:56.652
Especially the father, I thought for
a second it was actually him!

08:57.260 --> 09:01.303
By the way, Riju, why are you here with that Nijo Kakeru?

09:01.303 --> 09:04.611
Yeah, why is that, Riju? I'd just assumed
you'd be coming with Chisato.

09:04.782 --> 09:06.655
Don't tell me he's...! You swine!

09:07.391 --> 09:09.347
Looks like behavioral patterns run in the family, too.

09:11.493 --> 09:13.216
Oh, Kakeru's my...

09:14.607 --> 09:15.955
Riju!

09:16.373 --> 09:17.565
Pa-Papa!

09:18.208 --> 09:22.695
Riju, I was so worried! Are you all right?
No one tried to do anything indecent to you?

09:23.521 --> 09:25.694
So much for "all this time together."

09:26.800 --> 09:28.260
Kakeru!

09:29.173 --> 09:33.260
Better pack your bags, asshole!
I'll see you in court for kidnapping!

09:33.913 --> 09:36.782
Then you don't mind the Mizuki movie going bust?

09:38.086 --> 09:40.607
You little bastard, taking advantage
of other people's weaknesses...!

09:41.434 --> 09:43.651
Come on, Papa, that's enough!

09:43.913 --> 09:46.913
Oh, Shunsuke? You came with him?

09:46.913 --> 09:47.529
Yeah.

09:48.363 --> 09:50.260
Riju, who is this?

09:50.407 --> 09:54.494
You mean Shunsuke? He's my friend, and Papa's boyfriend.

09:55.495 --> 09:57.825
"Boyfriend"?!

09:57.825 --> 10:00.625
I won't have it!

10:06.006 --> 10:07.738
Tell me why, Chisato.

10:07.739 --> 10:11.912
I'm told Shunsuke-kun is still only a student--and
a male one, on top of that!

10:12.387 --> 10:14.782
But he's more mature than am!

10:15.140 --> 10:17.955
And these days, gender isn't so big of an issue...

10:17.956 --> 10:21.521
It's an astronomical issue!

10:32.086 --> 10:35.955
Listen to me, Chisato! Shunsuke-kun is Riju's friend.

10:35.956 --> 10:42.459
Spend a second thinking about how miserable a situation
it is for Riju, to have his father and friend be lovers!

10:45.128 --> 10:47.216
You will break up with that man immediately,

10:47.216 --> 10:50.477
or I won't allow Riju to go home to such an environment!

10:50.967 --> 10:56.216
Dad, you're being unreasonable! If you only
got to know what kind of person he is...!

10:56.216 --> 10:57.974
I will not allow it, not over my dead body!

11:01.346 --> 11:02.651
Dad...

11:11.738 --> 11:12.999
Are you okay?

11:13.000 --> 11:14.477
Ye-Yeah...

11:14.477 --> 11:17.869
Did he order you to break up with me?

11:21.998 --> 11:24.521
Chisato-san, there's no need to rush anything.

11:24.521 --> 11:27.390
Let's take our time, and bring your
father around to accept us

11:27.837 --> 11:28.999
Shunsuke...

11:34.969 --> 11:40.694
I've never been anything but proud of you. So I definitely
want Dad to recognize our relationship!

11:46.391 --> 11:48.149
Let's do our best.

11:48.869 --> 11:50.318
Don't bother.

11:54.130 --> 11:57.390
What in the hell are you doing?! Do it, Chidori!

11:57.477 --> 11:58.695
Yes, Dad.

12:03.607 --> 12:07.129
Chisato-san, let's meet again tomorrow in a different place!

12:07.216 --> 12:08.782
I'll contact you later!

12:08.825 --> 12:09.955
Got it!

12:10.547 --> 12:13.434
But wow, he's exactly like how Chisato-san used to be...

12:20.260 --> 12:24.477
Why won't he understand? What can I do to make him see?

12:27.825 --> 12:28.260
Riju!

12:28.260 --> 12:28.694
Papa!

12:29.782 --> 12:31.234
What's the matter, Riju?

12:32.694 --> 12:34.086
You're crying!

12:34.086 --> 12:36.346
Did that bastard Kakeru force you...?

12:36.346 --> 12:38.042
That's not it, Papa.

12:38.366 --> 12:41.303
We're not even staying in the same room.

12:41.303 --> 12:46.912
And just now, I was going to introduce
Kakeru as my boyfriend, but...

12:47.917 --> 12:49.260
Kakeru's my...

12:49.260 --> 12:50.295
his friend.

12:51.421 --> 12:52.739
That's what he told them!

12:53.131 --> 12:57.912
That little punk! He just lied to avoid them interfering
like they are with me and Shunsuke!

12:58.386 --> 13:03.217
Maybe I really just can't satisfy Kakeru as a lover.

13:03.869 --> 13:06.999
I mean I'm still a kid, and I even have a curfew...

13:07.000 --> 13:08.477
You're talking nonsense!

13:09.022 --> 13:14.236
There isn't a person on this planet as cute as you are,
and he's overjoyed just having you beside him!

13:15.361 --> 13:17.607
Have a little more confidence in yourself!

13:17.607 --> 13:18.656
Papa!

13:19.782 --> 13:24.521
You know I was afraid my heart was going
to stop when I found out you'd run away!

13:24.787 --> 13:26.346
I'm sorry, Papa!

13:26.346 --> 13:30.042
But when I thought of not being able to
see Kakeru at all during winter break,

13:30.042 --> 13:32.216
I got so scared, I just had to be with him...

13:32.782 --> 13:33.695
I see...

13:34.088 --> 13:38.130
Before I knew it Riju grew old enough to truly fall in love.

13:38.913 --> 13:41.869
Then you should just break up with that guy!

13:42.472 --> 13:44.347
Uh-oh! I blurted out what I really think!

13:46.521 --> 13:48.868
Riju, all I meant by that was, um...

13:49.564 --> 13:53.607
Papa, you're really not going to accept Kakeru, are you.

13:53.733 --> 13:54.955
I...

13:54.956 --> 13:57.652
Fine, forget it! I choose Kakeru!

13:57.652 --> 13:59.043
Riju!

14:03.701 --> 14:05.703
Choose Kakeru over me...

14:08.706 --> 14:12.086
He really cares about Kakeru that much...?

14:12.086 --> 14:13.172
Chisato-san!

14:16.714 --> 14:17.955
Shunsuke!

14:17.956 --> 14:19.000
Good!

14:19.477 --> 14:22.130
I thought coming out here would let us be alone together!

14:22.130 --> 14:23.607
Your hands are so cold!

14:23.607 --> 14:24.955
How long have you been here?

14:25.652 --> 14:26.434
It's all right.

14:27.183 --> 14:29.477
I'll just take your heat.

14:30.042 --> 14:31.477
Shunsuke...

14:34.649 --> 14:36.869
Chisato-san, there's something I need to tell you.

14:36.869 --> 14:38.825
What is it, Shunsuke?

14:42.240 --> 14:44.826
We... should break up.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.607
What did he just say...?

14:50.607 --> 14:53.781
"Break up"? What's he talking about?

14:54.168 --> 14:56.999
Shunsuke, why are you saying that all of a sudden?

14:57.000 --> 15:00.216
Weren't we going to work together
and get everyone to understand?

15:00.633 --> 15:03.135
Goodbye, Chisato-san.

15:10.652 --> 15:14.738
Why? I thought... we were so in love...

15:14.739 --> 15:17.275
Why won't he explain anything?

15:19.607 --> 15:24.615
I... I'm not going to let you just walk away from me like this!

15:25.607 --> 15:26.434
Shunsuke!

15:29.000 --> 15:30.608
Where are you, Shunsuke?

15:31.825 --> 15:33.651
Damn it, I lost sight of him...

15:35.521 --> 15:38.955
He's dreaming if he thinks I'd go along
with such an unreasonable goodbye!

15:42.434 --> 15:46.763
Shunsuke... I'm sure I saw him run this way.

15:53.519 --> 15:54.477
Shunsuke!

15:54.477 --> 15:55.521
Quiet now.

15:55.938 --> 15:58.315
Can you see over there, next to that signpost?

16:01.130 --> 16:02.825
Where the hell did he go?

16:02.825 --> 16:05.869
Well, it doesn't matter. As long as they've split up.

16:08.910 --> 16:12.695
You knew Dad had followed me here?

16:12.695 --> 16:14.652
I realized it halfway through.

16:15.166 --> 16:21.964
I'll tell you one thing - they can put cockroaches in my food and
make my bed with bloodstained sheets, doesn't bother me a bit.

16:22.913 --> 16:25.051
They've already started harassing him like that?!

16:25.385 --> 16:31.260
But, I am not so forbearing when it comes to interrupting
our private time together as lovers.

16:31.641 --> 16:34.477
That? That's the part you're fussing about?

16:34.977 --> 16:38.086
I'm not going to put up with being kept under
surveillance every minute we're here.

16:38.086 --> 16:41.346
And if we make them think we broke
up, you can elicit some sympathy.

16:41.346 --> 16:44.520
But I thought we were going to work
together and bring everyone around!

16:45.391 --> 16:47.738
I'm not going to lose any sleep if they don't!

16:47.739 --> 16:51.999
If I have to, I'll take you and Riju and we can elope!

16:54.539 --> 16:56.652
That's how I really feel.

16:57.173 --> 16:58.607
That's right!

16:58.607 --> 17:01.477
I'd forgotten, this is the kind of guy he is!

17:01.477 --> 17:05.391
Then you didn't really mean it when
you said we should break up?

17:05.550 --> 17:07.130
Of course I didn't!

17:07.130 --> 17:12.434
Forgive me. I swear I'll never say anything
like that again, not even as a lie.

17:14.391 --> 17:19.397
Dad might be right. And I'm sorry for what I'm doing to Riju.

17:20.148 --> 17:24.086
But despite all that, I... I want to be with Shunsuke!

17:28.913 --> 17:30.739
Kakeru, let's leave!

17:31.159 --> 17:31.956
Riju?

17:31.956 --> 17:34.130
I mean, Papa's being a total jerk!

17:34.130 --> 17:36.607
He's just stubbornly insisting I break up with you!

17:36.607 --> 17:41.042
We can't even stay in the same room, and you don't
want Papa getting in our way again, either, right?

17:42.303 --> 17:47.042
Sorry, you're probably getting tired,
too, of going out with me...

17:47.564 --> 17:52.521
Oh-Oh no, if I start crying now,
I'll just be bothering Kakeru...

17:59.187 --> 18:03.303
If I wanted a casual fling, I'm surrounded
by dozens of people I could hook up with.

18:03.303 --> 18:07.695
But I still practically made a runaway out of you
just to bring you here. Why do you think that is?

18:09.197 --> 18:11.782
To lure Papa here... or something?

18:12.200 --> 18:15.129
Riju, you're a real natural, you know that?

18:16.695 --> 18:22.376
Meeting you taught me how tiresome
superficial relationships are.

18:24.868 --> 18:29.999
Of course I'm not getting tired. Just
being with you is soothing to me.

18:30.868 --> 18:32.053
Kakeru!

18:33.956 --> 18:37.868
And besides, the reason you want Chisato-san
to accept us is because you love him, isn't it?

18:38.476 --> 18:39.651
That guy...

18:40.868 --> 18:42.868
Then you shouldn't do anything to make him worry.

18:43.346 --> 18:44.781
I guess I've got no choice.

18:44.782 --> 18:48.607
There isn't a fiber in my being that wants to, but
maybe I can give them a little bit of approval...

18:48.607 --> 18:50.651
Oh, Kakeru! Wait!

18:50.863 --> 18:52.217
Kakeru, you piece of shit!

18:53.130 --> 18:56.346
Just when I was considering deigning
to approve of your relationship...!

18:56.811 --> 19:00.781
You don't have to approve, I just wish you'd stop interfering.

18:56.811 --> 19:00.998
Why are you like this? Is it because you've got a pretty face? A sexy voice?

19:00.782 --> 19:01.424
Papa!

19:03.334 --> 19:05.216
You're really okay with us being together?

19:05.503 --> 19:10.043
Ye-Yeah... A little. Only a little, got it?

19:11.259 --> 19:11.999
Kakeru!

19:13.130 --> 19:14.521
That's great news, Riju.

19:14.521 --> 19:18.651
I acknowledge that the two of you are dating, but whether
or not you're suitable for Riju is an entirely separate issue!

19:18.652 --> 19:22.130
Now, we're going home! If you stay here with
this beast, who knows when he'll eat you!

19:22.130 --> 19:23.390
Let go of me, Papa!

19:23.478 --> 19:25.478
I want to be eaten!

19:26.391 --> 19:28.086
How can you say such things, Riju!

19:28.086 --> 19:29.433
Hey, Papa, let go!

19:29.434 --> 19:31.970
All right, it's Dad's turn next.

19:29.543 --> 19:31.962
Kakeru, eat me!

19:40.000 --> 19:42.521
Chisato! Good morning!

19:44.913 --> 19:45.710
Chisato?

19:47.545 --> 19:51.049
Dad, Shunsuke... he dumped me.

19:51.868 --> 19:53.434
O-Oh, did he?

19:53.434 --> 19:56.303
He left you to do what's best for Riju.

19:56.762 --> 20:01.607
As Riju's father and his friend, both of you
can move ahead in a new direction now.

20:02.852 --> 20:03.770
Okay...

20:08.695 --> 20:09.782
Amazing!

20:09.868 --> 20:14.129
All we did was make him think we'd split up,
and now he thinks Shunsuke's a good guy!

20:15.173 --> 20:19.410
Oh, damn. I forgot to tell Chisato
to give me a hand with work.

20:20.217 --> 20:22.477
I'm gonna call Shunsuke and tell him about it right now!

20:23.748 --> 20:26.217
Hey, Shunsuke? It's me.

20:26.500 --> 20:28.651
Dad actually just came by my room...

20:28.652 --> 20:33.130
Yeah, you won't be getting harassed by Dad anymore.

20:33.130 --> 20:35.051
I'll head over there right now.

20:36.552 --> 20:40.043
Yeah. I love you, too, Shunsu... KE!

20:40.086 --> 20:42.520
You are the most ungrateful, disrespectful little brat!

20:42.607 --> 20:46.129
You would lie to your own father
just to go out with that man?!

20:46.130 --> 20:48.564
Oh no, we got caught in the worst possible way!

20:49.023 --> 20:50.912
That's enough, Chisato!

20:51.359 --> 20:53.913
You're getting serious about a relationship with a kid!

20:53.913 --> 20:56.249
You know he just fell in love with your face, anyway!

20:56.868 --> 20:57.999
Get your head out of the clouds!

20:58.824 --> 21:04.478
Shunsuke's an incredible guy! He put up with my
abuse for four years and still said he loved me!

21:06.457 --> 21:11.608
If he only wanted me for my looks, your harassment
would have sent him packing ages ago!

21:14.382 --> 21:15.564
Fine.

21:15.564 --> 21:18.469
If it means that much to you, I'll test him myself.

21:23.042 --> 21:24.520
Ni-Niisan!

21:24.521 --> 21:26.260
You come this way.

21:26.260 --> 21:29.522
I'll show you that guy's true colors.

21:37.173 --> 21:39.086
Chisato-san's taking a long time...

21:40.478 --> 21:42.782
Shunsuke! Sorry I'm late!

21:43.160 --> 21:44.578
Dad showed up and started hassling me...

21:48.416 --> 21:49.173
What is it?

21:49.792 --> 21:50.868
No, nothing.

21:50.868 --> 21:55.521
Anyway, what do you want to do?
There's still some time before shooting starts.

21:55.988 --> 21:57.477
O-Oh, yeah...

21:58.913 --> 22:02.695
Well, Dad and the others have kept getting
in the way ever since we got here.

22:03.264 --> 22:05.695
So I want to... really do it.

22:06.217 --> 22:08.018
Could we...?

22:11.434 --> 22:13.816
Hook, line, and sinker, Shunsuke!

22:14.217 --> 22:16.260
Let me out of here, Niisan!

22:16.260 --> 22:18.654
Dad disguised as me is going to Shunsuke's room and...!

22:19.530 --> 22:24.738
If Shunsuke can't even tell us apart
and he tries to assault me,

22:24.739 --> 22:27.825
then you will accept that he was never anything more
than shallow, and abandon the relationship!

22:27.825 --> 22:28.695
Understood?

22:29.217 --> 22:34.837
That's all well and good, but if he really does come
on to you, then what are you going to do?!

22:35.564 --> 22:37.506
1-1 hadn't thought that far.

22:38.521 --> 22:41.129
I can't shake him off! His strength is ridiculous...!

22:43.564 --> 22:49.955
Uh, uh oh! I'm not Chisato! But, but
why am I getting so flustered...?

22:49.956 --> 22:52.521
It's too late! My head's gone completely blank!

22:52.730 --> 22:56.955
I kind of need you to start resisting
right about now, Chihiro-san.

22:56.956 --> 22:59.564
What? When did you notice?

23:00.112 --> 23:01.521
From the moment I saw you.

23:01.521 --> 23:08.651
Damn it! I was sure my super body capable of 300 sit-ups, back
extensions, and push-ups would cover for the age difference!

23:08.996 --> 23:11.086
It's true that you're identical on the outside,

23:11.086 --> 23:13.433
but I would never mistake anyone else for the man I love.

23:14.303 --> 23:18.651
So even if you fall head over heels for me,
Chisato-san is the only one I'll touch.

23:19.715 --> 23:21.425
Oh? Am I wrong?

23:22.051 --> 23:24.607
You went through all the trouble
of impersonating Chisato-san...

23:24.607 --> 23:27.390
I was just testing y you!

23:34.782 --> 23:38.825
The fact that Dad said we could stay in
the same room, if only just for tonight,

23:38.825 --> 23:41.612
means he's accepted our relationship at least a little, right?

23:42.863 --> 23:45.738
Now, we can finally relax and be alone together.

23:45.739 --> 23:46.782
Yeah...

23:49.703 --> 23:54.333
Oh, wait! If you're here, then what about Riju? Where is he?

23:55.292 --> 23:57.130
He's with Kakeru-san.

23:57.130 --> 23:59.477
What?! I won't allow it, Kakeru!

23:59.755 --> 24:00.673
No!

24:04.260 --> 24:06.259
Shun-Shunsuke!

24:06.260 --> 24:10.057
Look at me right now. Nobody else.

24:10.641 --> 24:11.695
All right...

24:13.227 --> 24:15.607
I love you, Kakeru.

24:15.607 --> 24:17.231
I love you, too, Riju.

24:21.121 --> 24:25.216
Shunsuke, I'm Riju's father...

24:25.217 --> 24:26.564
Chisato-san?

24:26.907 --> 24:31.955
So, I think I'm going to act with the greatest
consideration for Riju, like I did just now.

24:32.788 --> 24:35.825
That might be something that hurts you.

24:35.825 --> 24:43.090
But... I'll give you all the rest of my
love! I hope you'll forgive me.

24:43.924 --> 24:46.130
That's how I really feel.

24:47.913 --> 24:50.695
That's more than enough, Chisato-san.

24:50.695 --> 24:51.765
Shunsuke!

25:01.317 --> 25:02.485
Okay, see you later!

25:03.360 --> 25:06.346
Riju, won't you stay here a while?

25:06.864 --> 25:08.346
Huh? Why?

25:08.346 --> 25:12.244
You don't want to go home with your best friend and
your father in that kind of relationship, do you?

25:13.120 --> 25:16.739
I'm really happy that Papa and Shunsuke are so close.

25:16.739 --> 25:21.217
I wish Papa and Shunsuke could get married,
then we could really be family.

25:26.564 --> 25:29.173
He... He's a real heavy hitter.

25:30.721 --> 25:31.805
Time to go, Riju.

25:32.217 --> 25:33.608
Coming!

25:35.809 --> 25:36.738
Chihiro-san.

25:36.739 --> 25:37.912
Wha-What?

25:38.687 --> 25:44.042
I'll be coming back here eventually to ask for your precious
Chisato-san, so go easy on me when I do, hm?

25:45.564 --> 25:50.694
And by then I can say for certain that I'll be even
more handsome, so don't go falling for me.

25:50.991 --> 25:52.173
Don't show your face here again!

25:53.217 --> 25:54.956
What'd you tell him, Shunsuke?

25:55.000 --> 25:57.782
Just gave him my respects and said I'd come again.

25:58.207 --> 25:59.173
Oh, did you?

25:59.173 --> 25:59.912
Mm-hmm.

26:00.391 --> 26:02.346
Kakeru, come on, let's go!

26:02.346 --> 26:05.042
It's dangerous to hurry like that.

26:05.297 --> 26:06.868
No, I'm fine...

26:10.000 --> 26:11.000
See?

26:11.521 --> 26:14.260
Hey! You two right there, break it up!

26:14.913 --> 26:16.042
Let's go, Riju!

26:16.042 --> 26:17.651
Okay, Kakeru!

26:18.607 --> 26:20.390
Hold it, Riju!

26:21.564 --> 26:26.955
Hey, I told you to wait! Are you listening to me?!
